        "CopyrightInformation": "This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A 73 years-old gentleman presented to ED complaining of colicky abdominal pain and subacute bowel obstruction with nausea and unable to pass stools for a couple of days. Abdomen was distended, painful at deep palpation, with no guarding. AXR showed colonic distension of the right and proximal transverse colon. Left colonic section was not visible. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved."
